o challenges associated with AI systems collaborating across modalities, such as the need for large amounts of labeled data, the complexity of integrating multiple modalities, and the potential for bias and errors. To overcome these challenges, researchers and developers are working on developing new algorithms and techniques for multimodal learning and interaction, and exploring new applications and use cases for AI systems collaborating across modalities."}, "choose model result": {"id": "ChatGPT", "reason": "ChatGPT performs well on some NLP tasks as well."}}]
